.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
.psyntient/
.git.bak/

# Claude Code session-handoff / tooling files — dev-process notes for
# continuing work in this coding tool, not part of the shipped app.
NEXT_SESSION.md
.claude/

# OpenClaw is the one component NOT vendored here — a huge, independently
# fast-moving upstream (~5GB checkout). Pulled fresh from real upstream
# per Cortex/versions.json's pin; never stored in this repo. Cortex_Agent
# and Noetic_Interface/web ARE tracked here now (this repo is both the
# full-app backup and the update source) — see NEXT_SESSION.md-equivalent
# reasoning in the 2026-08-24 session: neither has meaningful content to
# lose by folding into this repo (neither had its own remote), and their
# actual source is what "a fully functional app" needs.
Cortex/Open-Claw/

# Accumulated session/memory state (Cortex_Agent) — dev-machine-specific
# history, not needed to reconstruct a working app. AGENTS.md's own
# first-run bootstrap flow creates these fresh; nothing here is a
# required template.
Cortex/Cortex_Agent/MEMORY.md
Cortex/Cortex_Agent/memory/

# Runtime/private data — not part of the versioned app. Both directories
# are fully self-constructing (daemon/vault.mjs's activateLocal() and
# daemon/working-memory.mjs's ensureScaffold(), both idempotent, both
# called unconditionally on every launch) — nothing here is required
# content, not even as a template.
Neural_Vault/local/
Working_Memory/*
!Working_Memory/.gitkeep
logs/*
!logs/.gitkeep

# Debris from OpenClaw CLI ever being run outside Cortex/Open-Claw
/.clawhub/
/.openclaw/
Cortex/openclaw-state/

# Plugin dependency tree: typebox (required for agent tool schemas) and a
# file: link to the local OpenClaw checkout for the plugin SDK. Reinstalled
# with `npm install` in that directory; the lockfile pins the local path and
# is machine-specific.
Noetic_Interface/gateway-plugin/node_modules/
Noetic_Interface/gateway-plugin/package-lock.json
